{"id":"n24524-1-8","stage":1,"title":"국적 · 国籍","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24524-1-8-1","ko":"먼저 성함과 국적을 말씀해 주시겠어요?","zh":"请问您能先告诉我您的姓名和国籍吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성함과","meaning":"姓名","explanation":"성함：姓名；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"성함","audio":"/audio/26f5e99b692ad469881e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49073","senseId":"1","lemma":"성함","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국적을","meaning":"国籍","explanation":"국적：国籍；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"국적","audio":"/audio/42be66ead3938d2c4a2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24524","senseId":"1","lemma":"국적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말씀해","meaning":"说，说话","explanation":"말씀하다：说，说话；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"말씀하다","audio":"/audio/e90996cf12d134d920d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17200","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주시겠어요?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]},{"id":"26f5e99b692ad469","term":"성함","zh":"姓名","audio":"/audio/26f5e99b692ad469881e.mp3","entryId":"49073","definition":"(尊称)人的名字。","pronunciation":["성ː함"]},{"id":"42be66ead3938d2c","term":"국적","zh":"国籍","audio":"/audio/42be66ead3938d2c4a2d.mp3","entryId":"24524","definition":"成为一个国家成员的资格。","pronunciation":["국쩍"]},{"id":"e90996cf12d134d9","term":"말